<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!-- GENERATED by sim/gen_worlds.py - do not hand-edit.
     Tier: furnished (real + floor-standing furniture WITH collision that the map does not contain (unmapped clutter), staff meshes, prayer mats)
     Collision geometry is copied verbatim from worlds/hospital.world (the world
     the runs_v5 benchmark numbers refer to). gz-sim Harmonic, SDF 1.9.
     Photoreal pass obeys the lidar-plane rule: the LD19 scans one horizontal
     plane at z=0.1535 m and gz's gpu_lidar sees VISUALS, not collisions, so
     every decorative visual lies wholly below 0.1 m or above 0.3 m. -->
